{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1320511-what-about-creating-one-off-fae-souls","id":1320511,"title":"What about Creating One off Fae Souls","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-06-24T09:23:46-07:00","id":1320511,"title":"What about Creating One off Fae Souls","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">So I got an idea. What about individually crafter Fae Souls? Like Boggan or Knocker Dvargr want to make their own Galatea as a Magnum Opus. This could be a single crafter project but hell more likely a group endeavor. Maybe a childe or protege dies to cold Iron so they give their all to make one. They Succeed and make a singular Fae Soul. So with this one off they embrace it into the Changeling Way and it becomes a Fae rather then say an Inanimae.<br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Should they perform <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">a ritual so the next time a chosen target gets pregnant the child is born a changeling? Or do they chose a mortal and go all Sidhe on the target and remove the Soul? Or maybe if they find a coma victim or a dying target like with how Demons choose hosts and merge the fae with the dying soul?</span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Or is it possible to create a human body wholesale and place it in it? What did the new Autumn Fae do, didn't they all just get reborn as a baby so the Autumn Sidhe were all starting as babies?<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1C1E21\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">I'm thinking it could even be a group of idealists who are tallying up a Fae Census and trying to figure out how many Changelings died to Cold Iron and they are making an effort to produce that many new fae souls at least. And these one off Fae could be Automatons or Cyborgs if made by Knockers or possibly fleshy or bestial if sorcerously created out of Chimerical Parts. Or even Elemental beings like stone fleshed Galatea like beings.</span></span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}